### 4.9 Cart (Keranjang)

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Deskripsi |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/carts` | customer | Isi keranjang |
| POST | `/api/carts/items` | customer | Tambah item |
| PUT | `/api/carts/items/:cart_item_id` | customer | Ubah jumlah |
| DELETE | `/api/carts/items/:cart_item_id` | customer | Hapus item |

**Tambah Item** — `200`

```json
{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": "uuid", "jumlah": 1 },
    { "product_id": "uuid", "jumlah": 2 }
  ]
}
```

Minimal 1 item; `jumlah` ≥ 1. Respons: `items[{cart_item_id, product_id, jumlah, subtotal}]` + `total`.

**Get Cart** — `200` → `cart_id`, `items[{cart_item_id, product_id, jumlah, subtotal, nama_produk, harga, image_url}]`, `total_item`, `total`.

